{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 01 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CNN 主干：从大规模分类到现代卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN Backbones</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_081_vgg_16_19-title\">VGG-16/19</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以高度同质的 3×3 plain-convolution blocks 规律加深到 16/19 层，无残差连接。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Homogeneous stacking of 3×3 plain convolutional blocks systematically deepened to 16–19 layers without residual shortcuts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">固定尺寸 RGB/医学 2D 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Fixed-size RGB or 2D grayscale medical image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">分类 logits 或供下游使用的多层卷积特征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Classification logits or multi-stage intermediate convolutional feature maps</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Table 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构表</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.1556\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"VGG-16/19 original paper architecture figure, Table 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/e353412f87eadd2a7faa.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Table 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">经典配置为 224×224；医学任务可替换通道与尺寸</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests fixed-size rgb or 2d grayscale medical image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"经典配置为 224×224；医学任务可替换通道与尺寸\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests fixed-size rgb or 2d grayscale medical image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">经典配置为 224×224；医学任务可替换通道与尺寸</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests fixed-size rgb or 2d grayscale medical image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"2×3×3 Conv-64 后 2×2 max-pool\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Conv Block 1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Conv Block 1\" data-node-name-en=\"Conv Block 1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Conv Block 1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">2×3×3 Conv-64 后 2×2 max-pool</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Conv Block 1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"2×3×3 Conv-128 后 max-pool\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Conv Block 2 within the core deep plain small kernel cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Conv Block 2\" data-node-name-en=\"Conv Block 2\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Conv Block 2</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">2×3×3 Conv-128 后 max-pool</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Conv Block 2 within the core deep plain small kernel cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"VGG-16 为 3 层、VGG-19 为 4 层 3×3 Conv-256\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Conv Block 3 within the core deep plain small kernel cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Conv Block 3\" data-node-name-en=\"Conv Block 3\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Conv Block 3</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">VGG-16 为 3 层、VGG-19 为 4 层 3×3 Conv-256</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Conv Block 3 within the core deep plain small kernel cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3/4 层 3×3 Conv-512 后 max-pool\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Conv Block 4 within the core deep plain small kernel cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Conv Block 4\" data-node-name-en=\"Conv Block 4\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Conv Block 4</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3/4 层 3×3 Conv-512 后 max-pool</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Conv Block 4 within the core deep plain small kernel cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3/4 层 3×3 Conv-512 后 max-pool\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Conv Block 5 within the core deep plain small kernel cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Conv Block 5\" data-node-name-en=\"Conv Block 5\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Conv Block 5</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3/4 层 3×3 Conv-512 后 max-pool</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Conv Block 5 within the core deep plain small kernel cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"两层 4096-unit FC+ReLU+dropout，再接分类层\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Fully Connected Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"全连接头\" data-node-name-en=\"Fully Connected Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全连接头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Fully Connected Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">两层 4096-unit FC+ReLU+dropout，再接分类层</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Fully Connected Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"softmax logits；卷积块也常被截取作 encoder/感知特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces classification logits or multi-stage intermediate convolutional feature maps via Class Logits Output.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"类别输出\" data-node-name-en=\"Class Logits Output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_081_vgg_16_19', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">类别输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Class Logits Output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">softmax logits；卷积块也常被截取作 encoder/感知特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces classification logits or multi-stage intermediate convolutional feature maps via Class Logits Output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"VGG-16/19 Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 连续小卷积核形成更大有效感受野</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Stacked 3×3 Kernels Emulating Large Effective Receptive Fields</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"VGG-16/19：核心公式 · 连续小卷积核形成更大有效感受野\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"81\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"17.865756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.463972 -69.00913 245.175704 17.865756\" width=\"245.175704pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><use id=\"m081_g10-2\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g7-2\"></use><use id=\"m081_g10-3\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g7-3\"></use><use id=\"m081_g10-185\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g7-185\"></use><use id=\"m081_g10-186\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g7-186\"></use><path d=\"M3.235687 17.012169C1.806426 15.314923 1.40941 11.126396 1.40941 8.377054S1.806426 1.449111 3.235687-.248135L3.106656-.555824C2.024786 .674929 .496271 3.444121 .496271 8.377054S1.965233 16.07918 3.106656 17.309932L3.235687 17.012169Z\" id=\"m081_g4-16\"></path><path d=\"M.297763 17.012169L.426793 17.309932C1.568216 16.07918 3.037178 1