3\"></use><use x=\"-12.051553\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g20-50\" y=\"-54.316653\"></use><use x=\"-4.42019\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g10-3\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"3.004134\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g16-100\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"9.220808\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g4-16\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"12.707715\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g16-44\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"21.893255\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g20-51\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"25.82053\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g7-2\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"30.736885\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g20-51\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"20.977507\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g13-18\" y=\"-54.316653\"></use><use x=\"24.828415\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g7-184\" y=\"-54.316653\"></use><use x=\"29.453869\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g20-49\" y=\"-54.316653\"></use><use x=\"37.085233\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g10-3\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"44.350157\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g16-17\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"49.501636\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g13-18\" y=\"-55.950221\"></use><use x=\"54.049918\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g4-17\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"58.592849\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g4-17\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"64.596911\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g16-150\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"78.820185\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g23-82\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"85.465264\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g23-70\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"91.502624\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g10-185\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"95.218684\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g23-51\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"102.41387\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g10-2\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"110.963972\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g23-51\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"115.945292\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g16-150\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"120.205926\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g23-51\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"127.401112\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g10-2\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"135.951214\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g23-51\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"140.932534\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g10-186\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"147.515542\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g1-61\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"156.619111\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g23-53\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"163.814297\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g10-2\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"172.364399\" xlink:href=\"#m081_g23-53\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">早期 CNN 使用较大卷积核且结构异质，深度扩展规律不清</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Early CNNs relied on heterogeneous large kernels (11×11, 7×7) with unclear scaling rules for network depth.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用连续 3×3 卷积和周期性池化把网络规律地加深到 16/19 层</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Replace large kernels with homogeneous stacks of 3×3 convolutions interleaved with 2×2 max-pooling up to 16–19 weight layers.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以小卷积堆叠扩大有效感受野并形成可迁移的层级特征</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Stacked 3×3 filters capture equivalent large receptive fields with fewer parameters and deeper non-linearities.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">长期作为医学影像迁移学习、感知损失和编码器基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Widely used for early medical transfer learning, perceptual feature losses, and 2D encoder initialization.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">历史主干与表征参照；参数量大、缺残差连接，现已少作首选</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Historical reference and perceptual loss extractor; heavy FC parameters and lack of residual paths limit modern primary use.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">连续堆叠 3×3 卷积，以多个非线性和较少参数获得等效大感受野。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">每个 stage 通过 max-pool 降采样并增加通道，形成规则层级特征。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">网络是 plain feed-forward CNN，无 residual shortcuts；超深优化和全连接参数量因此受限。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Replace large kernels with homogeneous stacks of 3×3 convolutions interleaved with 2×2 max-pooling up to 16–19 weight layers.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Stacked 3×3 filters capture equivalent large receptive fields with fewer parameters and deeper non-linearities.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Stacked 3×3 Kernels Emulating Large Effective Receptive Fields.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可作为迁移学习、感知损失和传统医学 2D encoder 的历史参照。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">参数量与显存效率弱于现代残差/轻量主干，且 ImageNet 纹理偏置不能替代医学域预训练。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Widely used for early medical transfer learning, perceptual feature losses, and 2D encoder initialization.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Historical reference and perceptual loss extractor; heavy FC parameters and lack of residual paths limit modern primary use.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.1556\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Very Deep Convolutional Networks for Large-Scale Image Recognition</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<span class=\"spec-muted-val\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">未提供官方实现</span><span class=\"lang-en\">No Official Repository</span></span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
